**6.** I read `orchestrator/inbox/adv-codex.last` and record B7. I run `herdr agent get` and `herdr agent read <name> --source visible` on both advisors, and compact first if context is at 50% or more. Then two Bash calls, background, in one message:
```bash
herdr agent prompt adv-codex "$(cat orchestrator/quorum/ballot-8.md)" --wait --timeout 900000; \
herdr agent read adv-codex --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > orchestrator/inbox/adv-codex.last
```
